  ($q$geo-630$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Geometry and Trigonometry$q$, $q$Right triangle trigonometry$q$, 2, null, $q$In right triangle PQR, the right angle is at Q and tan P = 7/24. If PQ = 48, what is the length of QR?$q$, $q$["50","48","38","14"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$tan P = QR/PQ, so QR = 48 × 7/24 = 14.$q$),
