  ($q$geo-637$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Geometry and Trigonometry$q$, $q$Similar triangles$q$, 2, null, $q$Triangle ABC is similar to triangle DEF, with AB corresponding to DE and BC corresponding to EF. If AB = 4, BC = 5, and DE = 12, what is the length of EF?$q$, $q$["19","13","15","20"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The scale factor is DE/AB = 12/4 = 3, so EF = 5 × 3 = 15.$q$),
