  ($q$geo-640$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Geometry and Trigonometry$q$, $q$Area and volume$q$, 2, null, $q$The total surface area of a cube is 600 square units. What is the volume of the cube, in cubic units?$q$, $q$["10000","6000","100","1000"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$Each of the 6 faces has area 100, so the edge length is 10. Volume = 10³ = 1000.$q$),
  ($q$geo-641$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Geometry and Trigonometry$q$, $q$Lines and angles$q$, 1, null, $q$Two angles are supplementary. If one angle measures 34°, what is the measure of the other angle, in degrees?$q$, $q$["156","34","326","146"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$Supplementary angles sum to 180°, so the other angle is 180° − 34° = 146°.$q$),
